        "Description": "Your first target is Omar-Al-Ghazali, a royal that has been accused multiple times of corruption. Our client wants to put an end to the controversy, and get him eliminated.\r\rIntel also suggests that journalist Hans Lucht will be coming to the ceremony. This journalist has come close to discovering ICA secrets multiple times, so you will need to put an end to him.\r\rGood hunting.",
